{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52489","headline":"别故人赋得淩云独鹤 · 王拊","name":"别故人赋得淩云独鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"单嘶淩碧雾，风扬入青云。\n九臯空顾侣，千里会离羣。\n望海飞恒急，摩天影讵分？\n欲知凄断意，琴里自当闻。\n（《文苑英华》卷二八五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王拊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52489.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52489","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}